Needle 3 on ESP32-S3

The C engine, firmware scaffold, and host test utilities derive from:
  andrisgauracs/needle-2-esp32
  https://github.com/andrisgauracs/needle-2-esp32
  revision 61cafad7014a5664bb3ffd5f0c457ce5aa6598ae
  Licensed under Apache License 2.0 (included in LICENSE and engine/NOTICE-LICENSE).

This project modifies that code for the Needle 3 archive and architecture,
adds a telemetry tool router and HTTP bridge, and supplies reproducible demos.

Needle 3 architecture and model weights are by Cactus Compute:
  https://cactuscompute.com/needle
  https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle3
Weights are downloaded separately. See model/manifest.json for provenance.

Demo recordings are produced with Charmbracelet VHS (MIT license):
  https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
VHS and its dependencies are not vendored in this repository.
